# Country City Service

Core microservice handling countries and cities data.

---

# Configuration

- Port: 8081
- Spring Boot REST API
- Connects to database (optional local setup)

---

#  Data Model

## Country
- id
- name

## City
- id
- name
- countryId
- population
- description

---

# 📡 API Endpoints (via Gateway)

## Countries

- GET /countries

---

## Cities by Country (Pagination)

- GET /countries/{countryId}/cities?page=0&size=10

---

## City Details

- GET /cities/{cityId}

---

# 🧠 Features

- Pagination support
- DTO mapping
- Service layer architecture
- Repository abstraction

---

# ❌ Error Handling

Global exception handling:

- 404 Not Found
- 400 Validation errors
- 500 Internal server errors

Response format includes:

- status
- error code
- message
- path
- timestamp
- correlationId

---

# 📖 Swagger

- http://localhost:8081/swagger-ui/index.html

---

# 🧪 Testing

Run:

bash
mvn test
Includes:
* Service tests
* Controller tests
* Exception tests
* Pagination tests

🚀 Purpose
This service demonstrates:
* Clean architecture
* REST API design
